{
  "bodyHash": "LNjmlta8Uac=",
  "content": "<h6 style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MinecraftCommon/blob/main/ProgressiveDifficulty/logo.png?raw=true\" width=\"800\" height=\"160\"> <br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 這個模組會隨著遊戲進程逐步提升難度，靈感來自<br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.terraria.org%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">泰拉瑞亞</a>的類似機制，同時結合<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraft.fandom.com%252fwiki%252fDifficulty\" rel=\"nofollow\">區域難度</a>系統以保持Minecraft風格。<br>詳細說明請參閱<a href=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MajruszsProgressiveDifficultyMod/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wiki頁面</a>。<br><strong><span style=\"color:#f00\">0.4.0版本起需搭配<a style=\"color:#f00\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/majrusz-library\" rel=\"nofollow\">Majrusz函式庫</a>才能運行！</span></strong><br></span> <br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MinecraftCommon/blob/main/ProgressiveDifficulty/game_stages.png?raw=true\" width=\"800\" height=\"85\"> <br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 遊戲進程分為三個階段，每階段都會新增難度調整並強化既有機制：<br><br>- <strong>普通模式</strong>：遊戲初始階段<br>- <strong>專家模式</strong>：當首位玩家進入地獄時觸發<br>(或其他模組添加的任意維度)<br>- <strong>大師模式</strong>：擊敗終界龍後開啟<br></span> <br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MinecraftCommon/blob/main/ProgressiveDifficulty/stuff.png?raw=true\" width=\"800\" height=\"85\"> <br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong>敵人群組系統</strong><br></span> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 敵人會以群組形式出現，包含一名首領與多名隨從，<br>隨從會跟隨首領攻擊相同目標。<br>隨從更容易持武器，首領則傾向穿戴護甲。<br></span> <img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MinecraftCommon/blob/main/ProgressiveDifficulty/group.gif?raw=true\" width=\"600\" height=\"338\"> <br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong>不死軍團</strong><br></span> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 擊殺足夠不死生物後觸發的新型襲擊事件，<br>最多5波攻勢，完成後可獲得寶藏袋獎勵。<br>難度會隨時間推移提升，並根據參與玩家數量動態調整！<br></span> <img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MinecraftCommon/blob/main/ProgressiveDifficulty/undead_army.gif?raw=true\" width=\"600\" height=\"338\"> <br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong>寶藏袋</strong><br></span> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 受泰拉瑞亞啟發的新戰利品系統，內含額外物品<br>並有機率開出獨特裝備。參與擊敗首領/襲擊事件的<br>每位玩家都會獲得專屬寶藏袋。當前可透過以下方式獲取：<br><strong>釣魚</strong>、<strong>不死軍團</strong>、<strong>襲擊</strong>、<strong>深海守衛</strong>、<strong>伏守者</strong>、<strong>凋零怪</strong>與<strong>終界龍</strong>。<br></span> <img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MinecraftCommon/blob/main/ProgressiveDifficulty/treasure_bags.png?raw=true\" width=\"600\" height=\"338\"> <br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong>流血機制</strong><br></span> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 所有動物與人類現在都可能流血。此效果類似中毒持續扣血，<br>可使用新物品<strong>繃帶</strong>解除。觸發來源包含劍刃、蜘蛛甚至仙人掌...<br>護甲值越高，流血機率越低。隨著遊戲階段推進，流血傷害會愈發致命，<br>隨身攜帶繃帶至關重要！<br></span> <img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MinecraftCommon/blob/main/ProgressiveDifficulty/bleeding.gif?raw=true\" width=\"600\" height=\"338\"> <br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong>終極合金錠</strong><br></span> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 為平衡後期難度，新增<strong>終極礦石</strong>可鍛造為終極合金錠，<br>用於升級獄髓裝備與工具！<br>終極礦生成於終界石層，終界建築中也有機會發現。<br></span> <img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MinecraftCommon/blob/main/ProgressiveDifficulty/enderium_ingot.png?raw=true\" width=\"600\" height=\"338\"> <br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong>還有更多內容！</strong><br></span> <br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MinecraftCommon/blob/main/ProgressiveDifficulty/languages.png?raw=true\" width=\"800\" height=\"185\"> <br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MinecraftCommon/blob/main/ProgressiveDifficulty/thanks.png?raw=true\" width=\"800\" height=\"85\"> <br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> - 音效由<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.instagram.com%252fmusiqeorn%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Julia</a>製作<br>- 俄文翻譯：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/chechnyacool488\" rel=\"nofollow\">chechnyacool488</a>, reyzex#1973, LolsShow, Faster Than Light團隊<br>- 部分素材由<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/muraokun/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">muraokun</a>提供<br>- 簡體中文翻譯：<a href=\"https://github.com/qsefthuopq\" rel=\"nofollow\">qsefthuopq</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/1mtwtfss1\" rel=\"nofollow\">1mtwtfss1</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/UDTakerBean\" rel=\"nofollow\">UDTakerBea</a><br>- 法文翻譯：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/kiryonn\" rel=\"nofollow\">kiryonn</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/maximemadani\" rel=\"nofollow\">maximemadani</a><br>- 西班牙文翻譯：Wallaby#8683, <a href=\"https://github.com/luskaner\" rel=\"nofollow\">luskaner</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/spliitbtw\" rel=\"nofollow\">spliitbtw</a><br>- 越南文翻譯：<a href=\"https://github.com/baooduy\" rel=\"nofollow\">baooduy</a><br>- 終極合金系列材質重製：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252flcycrystal%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">IcyCrystal</a><br>- 烏克蘭文翻譯：<a href=\"https://github.com/unroman\" rel=\"nofollow\">unroman</a><br>- 德文翻譯：<a href=\"https://github.com/florian-berger\" rel=\"nofollow\">florian-berger</a><br>- 繁體中文翻譯：<a href=\"https://github.com/zacky0904\" rel=\"nofollow\">zacky0904</a><br>- 日文翻譯：もふざとう (mohuzato)<br></span> <br><a href=\"https://discord.gg/9UF774WcuW\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MinecraftCommon/blob/main/Library/discord.png?raw=true\" width=\"800\" height=\"138\"> </a> <br><a href=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MajruszsProgressiveDifficultyMod/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MinecraftCommon/blob/main/Library/mod_wiki.png?raw=true\" width=\"800\" height=\"138\"> </a></h6>",
